@prefix hali: <https://w3id.org/hali#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# A cyclic subclass chain, only here: A ⊑ B ⊑ A ⊑ hali:Resource.
<http://example.org/A> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/B> , hali:Resource .
<http://example.org/B> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/A> .
